// protoConvertInkSlip: the floating slip for converting a word of ink (or
// typing a value): a title, an explanation, an entry line and optionally an
// on-screen keyboard (kbdType 'alpha or 'phone).  Closing it sends compMsg to
// compView with the entered text.
//   userTitle / userText   the slip's title and explanation
//   recFlags    extra recognition flags for the entry line
//   compView, compMsg, userData   who is told of the result, and how

protoConvertInkSlip := {
	viewBounds: {left: 0, top: 0, right: 225, bottom: 124},
	viewJustify: vjParentCenterH + vjParentCenterV,
	// space added below the last child (grows by a keyboard's height)
	extraHeight: 20,
	// before the children are made: fills in the title and text, picks the
	// keyboard (l4) and the entry line's flags
	viewSetupChildrenScript: func() begin
		local l1, strFontWidth2, l3, l4;
		l3 := 'symbol;
		infoText.text := userText;
		headerText.title := userTitle;
		strFontWidth2 := StrFontWidth(headerText.title, headerText.viewFont);
		headerText.viewBounds := SetBounds(0, 5, strFontWidth2, 15);
		if (kbdType = 'alpha) then begin
				l4 := '{_proto: @alphaKeys, viewBounds: {left: 1, top: -101, right: 226, bottom: -20}, viewJustify: vjParentCenterH + vjParentBottomV}
			end else begin
				if (kbdType = 'phone) then begin
						l4 := '{_proto: @phonePad, viewBounds: {left: 0, top: -146, right: 124, bottom: -20}, viewJustify: vjParentCenterH + vjParentBottomV};
						entryLine.viewFlags := vVisible + vClickable + vGesturesAllowed + vPhoneField
					end
			end;
		// the caller's recognition flags on top of a visible, tappable line
		// taking gestures
		if recFlags then begin
				entryLine.viewFlags := BOr(vVisible + vClickable + vGesturesAllowed, recFlags)
			end;
		if l4 then begin
				self.stepChildren := [Array: l4];
				extraHeight := (((extraHeight + 10) + l4.viewBounds.bottom) - l4.viewBounds.top)
			end;
		inherited:?viewSetupChildrenScript()
	end,
	// after setup: makes the slip just tall enough for its children (the
	// last one before the keyboard, plus extraHeight) and puts the caret in
	// the entry line
	viewSetupDoneScript: func() begin
		local copy, childViewFrames, l3, l4;
		childViewFrames := self:ChildViewFrames();
		copy := Clone(self.viewBounds);
		l4 := (Length(childViewFrames) - (if kbdType then 2 else 1));
		copy.bottom := ((childViewFrames[l4]:GlobalBox().bottom - self:GlobalBox().top) + extraHeight);
		SetValue(self, 'viewBounds, copy);
		inherited:?viewSetupDoneScript();
		SetKeyView(entryLine, 0)
	end,
	// puts the recognized text (richText) into the entry line
	Recognize: func() begin
		SetValue(entryLine, 'text, richText)
	end,
	ReOrientToScreen: @defRotateFunc,
	viewChildren: [viewChildren:
		{
			// the close box: sends compMsg(isInk, text, userData) to compView
			// with the entry line's text (isInk true when it holds ink), then
			// closes the slip.  For a phone conversion the brackets are
			// replaced by the same brackets - as the strings read here, a no-op.
			buttonClickScript: func() begin
				local copy;
				copy := Clone(entryLine:GetRichString());
				if phoneCvt then begin
						StrReplace(copy, "(", "(", 1);
						StrReplace(copy, ")", ")", 1)
					end;
				if compMsg then begin
						Perform(compView, compMsg, [Array: (not IsRichString(copy)), copy, userData])
					end;
				base:Close()
			end,
			_proto: @protoCancelButton
		},
		headerText,
		infoText,
		entryLine_3
	],
	headerText: nil,
	allocateContext: [|Array|: 'headerText, headerText, 'infoText, infoText, 'entryLine, entryLine_3],
	infoText: nil,
	entryLine: nil,
	_proto: @protoFloater
};

// the slip's title
headerText := {
	viewBounds: {left: 0, top: 8, right: 150, bottom: 15},
	viewJustify: vjParentCenterH,
	preallocatedContext: 'headerText,
	_proto: @protoTitle
};

// the explanation below the title
infoText := {
	viewBounds: {left: 10, top: 5, right: -10, bottom: 30},
	viewJustify: vjParentFullH + vjSiblingBottomV,
	preallocatedContext: 'infoText,
	_proto: @protoStaticText
};

// the entry line below the explanation
entryLine_3 := {
	viewBounds: {left: 10, top: 5, right: -10, bottom: 30},
	// oneLineOnly (8388608) + vjSiblingBottomV + vjParentClip + vjParentFullH
	viewJustify: 8396848,
	viewFlags: vVisible + vClickable + vGesturesAllowed + vCharsAllowed + vNumbersAllowed,
	preallocatedContext: 'entryLine,
	_proto: @protoInputLine
};
